# Never upload these to Vercel's static host.
#
# The site needs only the HTML, CSS, JS, and image assets. server.py is the
# local preview server (source code, no reason to publish it), and data/ holds
# waitlist email addresses when the preview server has been run locally.
# Git-integration deploys already exclude ignored paths, but a `vercel` CLI
# deploy uploads the working tree, so this list is the belt to .gitignore's
# braces.
server.py
README.md
data/
.github/
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
__pycache__/
*.log
